  "title": "Oven Roasted Turkish Walnut Pilaf",
  "description": "A nutty, crunchy pilaf featuring roasted walnuts, sultanas and aromatic spices, perfect for a warm, plant‑based meal.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
