  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "In a large oven‑proof skillet, heat 1 tbsp olive oil over medium heat and sauté diced onion and minced garlic until translucent.",
    "Add the chopped walnuts and toast for 3 minutes, stirring frequently to coat with oil.",
    "Stir in cumin, coriander, saffron water and sultanas, cooking for 2 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add rinsed rice, stir to combine, then pour in vegetable broth and remaining 1 tbsp olive oil; season with salt.",
    "Transfer skillet to the oven and roast for 20 minutes, then remove and let rest covered for 5 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork, garnish with chopped parsley, and serve hot."
  ],
